      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix olive oil with salt, pepper, and lemon juice and divide into plastic to-go containers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Add equal amounts of remaining ingredients to each container, including tomatoes, broccoli, cheddar cheese, ham, eggs, and pasta. Mix together with olive oil-lemon juice mixture and enjoy!",
